<p>Dreaming inputs include the pre-existing memory store and an array of sessions. The selected model runs the dreaming pipeline. During the research preview, <code>claude-opus-5</code>, <code>claude-fable-5</code>, <code>claude-opus-4-8</code>, <code>claude-opus-4-7</code>, <code>claude-sonnet-5</code>, and <code>claude-sonnet-4-6</code> are supported. You can optionally pass <code>instructions</code> to steer the dreaming process. See <a href="#steer-with-instructions">Steer with instructions</a>.</p>
<p>The response is the full <code>dream</code> resource with <code>status: &quot;pending&quot;</code>:</p>
